        "objectKey": "apexSource_6c9fd6769ae70ad1",
        "context": "Integer limitSize = 20;\n\nvoid helper(Integer n) {\n    System.debug(LoggingLevel.WARN, n);\n}\n\nSystem.debug('end');\nfor (Integer k = 0; k < 5; k++) {\n    if (k == 1) {\n        System.debug('skip');\n        continue;\n    }\n    if (k >= 2) {\n        System.debug('stop');\n        break;\n    }\n}\nhelper(limitSize);",
